DriverQ
===========================

This project visualizes and analyzes data from the nuScenes dataset:

  H. Caesar et al., "nuScenes: A Multimodal Dataset for Autonomous
  Driving," in Proc. IEEE/CVF Conference on Computer Vision and
  Pattern Recognition (CVPR), 2020.

  https://www.nuscenes.org/


